  <section class="individual text-left pb-3 pt-5">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-12">
          <div class="title-container">
            <img src="https://individualogist.com/soul-flame-tarot/assets/img/title-bg-v2.png" alt="Snow" style="width:100%;" class="long-title">
            <h3 class="centered">As A <span class="archetype">Creator</span>, These Are Your <span class="text-orange">Hidden Qualities, Unknown Tendencies,<br>And Positive Attributes</span> That You Wouldn't Expect</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="col-sm-4">
              <img src="../assets/images/abilities.png" style="width: 100%;">
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-8">
              <p>As a Creator, one of the traits that you generally have is your introversion. You prefer to hold yourself back from social interaction or otherwise limit yourself to a few people that you know personally. </p>
              <p>Generally, you are able to <span class="text-orange">thrive in a more enclosed social space</span>, as you are able to think in more detached and objective ways. Ultimately, this makes you a prolific thinker great for coming up with ideas for various problems or even new innovations. </p>
              <p>Add to that, another trait that you have is your egocentrism. You tend to be extremely aware of who you are as a person and are able to assess your strengths and weaknesses without fail. This often allows you to have a more moderate and proper response to any given situation.</p>
              <p>Aside from this, you are also decisive. You don’t get bogged down by self-doubt, even though you are ironically tempered and perhaps even pestered by it in every single decision that you make.</p>
              <p>As a thinker, you have a <span class="text-orange">preference for logic</span>. This is so because it serves your creative purpose well: being able to impose order upon everything you do means that you are able to plan for any contingency well before things go wrong, minimizing the amount of things you have to do while implementing your plans.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p>You are also remarkably articulate, expressing your thoughts with clarity and precision. This allows you to both lead, follow, and even argue your case to others without any failures.</p>
          <p>Creators are also very calm individuals, never letting their situations get to them. Since you are one of them, you have a capacity for discipline and duty that is truly worthy of the title: you have timetables, schedules, and a remarkable sense of self-organization to keep yourself ahead in the game.</p>
          <p>Aside from just being objective, however, you’re also quite optimistic about the future. <span class="text-orange">Doubt does not cloud your mind</span> at all, even though life forces you to feel a lot of it.</p>
          <p>That being said, there’s more about your potential than you understand at this juncture, <span class="username"></span>. </p>
          <p>With your hidden qualities in full view, it is time for you to know what your strengths are and how you can better use them...</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-12 text-center">
          <a class="btn btn-outline-success btn-1" id="nav-btn2" onclick="nextReading(1,2)">Show Me Now</a>
